Citroën DS

Citroën DS () adalah sebuah mobil eksekutif bermesin depan, penggerak roda depan yang diproduksi dan dipasarkan oleh perusahaan Prancis Citroën dari tahun 1955 sampai 1975. Tersedia dalam bentuk sedan (setelah-Citroën Type A with 4-door Conduite Intérieure bodywork with Taylor Made Auto Trunk on the back, Citroën Type B2 with 4-door Conduite Intérieure bodywork with Taylor Made Auto Trunk on the back, Citroën Type B10 with 4-door Conduite Intérieure bodywork with Taylor Made Auto Trunk on the back, 1928-1929 Citroën AC4 4-Door Berline with Taylor Made Auto Trunk on the back, 1930-1932 Citroën AC4 4-Door Berline with Taylor Made Auto Trunk on the back, dan Citroën Traction Avant 4-door trunk back berline), wagon/estate dan konvertibel. Pemahat Italia dan desainer industri Flaminio Bertoni dan insinyur penerbangan Prancis André Lefèbvre mendesain mobil ini. Paul Magès mengembangkan suspensi hidropneumatik, Sedan Citroën DS dirancang untuk bersaing dengan Alfa Romeo 1900/2000 Berlina, Borgward Hansa 2400 Pullman/P100, BMW 501 4-door sedan, Fiat 1900/1800/2100/2300 4-door sedan, Jaguar Mark 1/2, Ford Zephyr Mark I 4-door saloon/Zephyr Mark II 4-door saloon/Zephyr Mark III 4-door saloon/Zephyr Mark IV 4-door saloon, Ford Zodiac Mark I 4-door saloon/Zodiac Mark II 4-door saloon/Zodiac Mark III 4-door saloon/Zodiac Mark IV 4-door saloon, Austin A90 Westminster/A105 Westminster 4-door saloon/A99 Westminster/A110 Westminster, Humber Hawk Series I Saloon/Series II Saloon/Series III Saloon/Series IV Saloon, Tatra 603, Lancia Flaminia Berlina, Opel Kapitän 4-door sedan (1953–1958)/Kapitän P1 4-door sedan/Kapitän P2 4-door sedan/Diplomat A 4-door sedan/Diplomat B 4-door sedan, Renault Frégate 4-door sedan, dan Mercedes-Benz W120/W121/W111 4-door sedan.
